WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Can velocity be negative?

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.460
Yes.

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.570
Pick a direction as positive.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.580
Moving the other way is negative velocity.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.860
Speed is always positive.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:14.016
Velocity tells you which way.
